# Wallet material. `qnero-wallet keygen` writes an unencrypted spending key and
# a note store holding every note's rho and r; the default path is under the
# user's data directory, and these patterns cover a `--file` pointed here.
*.seed
*.seed.store.json
*.store.json
*.store.json.tmp*
